-- Are any completed items still marked as active?
-- Did this work surface anything that should be in "Next Up" or "Backlog"?
-
-Update TODO.md to reflect the current state before committing.
-
-> *Rationale*: TODO.md is the project's live state representation. Stale TODO state is state entropy — the project can't accurately describe its own condition.
